  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The gesture wheel (accessible via R1) does not actually work unless if SteamInput is forced on.\n\nForcing SteamInput on is an undesirable solution, as it causes the incorrect controller prompts to appear since SteamInput emulates an XInput device.\n\nAdditionally, the SteamInput profile simulates keypresses for its gesture wheel implementation, which can accidentally trigger some background applications that listen for global hotkeys.\n\nThis also means that non-Steam versions of VRChat (such as the VIVEPORT distribution) are completely unable to use the non-VR controller gesture wheel.\n\nTo resolve this, a native non-VR controller gesture wheel should be added (or fixed, if one already exists in the code) instead of relying on SteamInput.",
